abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for the exact extension of OEIS A049230 through
  27 steps. It contains the frozen C17/OpenMP enumerator and Makefile used for
  the exhaustive campaign through 22 steps, the complete campaign state and
  result, the canonical b-file, exact literature-derived terms through 27,
  bounded Python oracles, a pinned jOEIS verifier, and the final LaTeX
  manuscript source and PDF.
